ION Admin Public API Test Suite
=================================

This directory contains automated tests for ION's public administrative APIs,
demonstrating how to programmatically configure and operate ION nodes using
the C API instead of configuration files or command-line tools.

Examples for UDP and TCP are not provided due to the fact that these tests
are best conducted on separate hosts. The multi-node per host setup is not
currently supported in this test suite. This is a future enhancement.

Tests Included
--------------

1. ltp_admin_api_test.c
   - Tests LTP (Licklider Transmission Protocol) administrative functions
   - Demonstrates complete node initialization and configuration
   - Validates bundle transfer over LTP loopback
   - Tests: ion_initialize, ltp_init, add_span, add_seat, ltp_start
   - Includes BP initialization, scheme/endpoint setup, and protocol configuration

Test Utilities
--------------

- ion_test_utils.c/h
  - Shared helper functions for ION API testing
  - Process management utilities
  - Common test infrastructure with colored output
  - Cleanup and shutdown routines

Building
--------

The test is built as part of the normal ION build process:

    make buildcheck

This creates the executable: tests/admin_public_api/dotest

Running
-------

Run the test directly:

    cd tests/admin_public_api
    ./dotest

Or as part of the test suite:

    cd tests
    ./runtests

Expected Output
---------------

The test performs a complete LTP loopback configuration and sends a test
bundle. Success is indicated by "Payload delivered" in the output and
all tests passing with a green checkmark.

Exit Code
---------

- 0: All tests passed
- 1: One or more tests failed
